package CanvasNet {
    part def ExpressionFunctions {
        doc /* The internal static partial ExpressionFunctions with the ExpressionFunction delegate, the ExpressionFunctionContext, and the ExpressionRegex class: the closed table of the whitelisted pure functions that an expression may call (abs, acos, acosh, asin, asinh, atan, atan2, atanh, ceil, clamp, cos, cosh, exp, floor, log, log10, max, min, pow, round, sign, sin, sinh, sqrt, tan, tanh, trunc; lower, upper, trim, substring, slice, indexof, lastindexof, startswith, endswith, includes, replace, split, join, pad, length; isArray, isBoolean, isDate, isFinite, isNaN, isNumber, isObject, isRegExp, isString, isValid, toBoolean, toDate, toNumber, toString; regexp, test; and, from Phase 8, the date and time functions datetime, utc, time, timezoneoffset, date, day, year, month, hours, minutes, seconds, milliseconds, quarter, week, isoweek, dayofyear and their utc forms, timeOffset, utcOffset, timeSequence, utcSequence, timeUnitSpecifier, timeFormat, utcFormat, timeParse, utcParse, monthFormat, monthAbbrevFormat, dayFormat, and dayAbbrevFormat), with Names, TryGet, and Invoke (an unknown name is an ArgumentException) and no random, clock (now is not provided), reflection, file, or network function. The functions follow JavaScript and Vega results independently of the culture (negative zero kept, isNaN and isFinite not coercing, toBoolean, toNumber, and toString giving null for null and the empty string, pad aligned as in Vega), results are bounded by MaxStringLength, and the host math library is used for the transcendental functions. The date functions read and write dates through the TimeCalendar of the context (UTC when none is given; the utc functions always use UTC; years 0 to 99 are 1900 to 1999 and an instant outside the years 1 to 9999 is null or NaN), the format functions use TimeFormat (the string specifier compiled and cached per context, an object specifier a multi-format), a sequence is bounded by MaxScaleDomainSize and charged one step per date, and the specifier and text lengths of a format or a parse are charged. The ExpressionFunctionContext is the per-evaluation context that carries the calendar, counts the steps (Step, ChargeSteps, and ChargeSize for one step per 64 characters or elements of size-proportional work), polls the cancellation token, enforces the string limit, and caches at most 64 regular expressions and 64 time formatters; ExpressionRegex translates a JavaScript pattern (the flags g, i, m, and s, with u, v, y, and d rejected; at most 1,024 characters; \d, \w, and $ semantics adjusted) into a .NET Regex that uses RegexOptions.NonBacktracking with the invariant culture (a 5 second backstop timeout) and falls back for the patterns that engine rejects (look-around, back-references) to the backtracking engine with a 100 millisecond timeout that fails closed, an invalid or over-long pattern being a located VegaLiteRenderException. Color, geographic, scale, dataflow, and statistical functions, and now, are deferred and are reported by the FeatureCatalog. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Expressions/ExpressionFunctions.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Expressions/ExpressionFunctions.Text.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Expressions/ExpressionFunctions.Casing.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Expressions/ExpressionFunctions.Types.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Expressions/ExpressionFunctions.Regex.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Expressions/ExpressionFunctions.Time.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Expressions/ExpressionFunctionContext.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Expressions/ExpressionRegex.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Expressions/ExpressionFunctionsTests.cs and ExpressionFunctionsTimeTests.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-vega-lite/expressions/expression-functions.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-vega-lite/expressions/expression-functions.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-vega-lite/expressions/expression-functions.yaml */
    }
}
